BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kidical Mass TO
DTSTART:20260725T124500Z
DTEND:20260725T143000Z
DTSTAMP:20260719T074726Z
UID:4e4419fe-3580-50b5-8cab-777eec4a7b48
DESCRIPTION:Cycle Toronto is proud to power the return of Kidical Mass TO\
 , riding the last Saturday of every month through October.\n\nKidical Mass
  is an international movement for child- and cycling-friendly cities. Thes
 e rides are an all-ages\, all-abilities celebration of cycling that highli
 ghts the need for healthier\, safer streets.\n\nWhen: Meet at 8:45 AM\, de
 part at 9 AM\nWhere: Cycle Toronto Rec Hub at Evergreen Brick Works (550 B
 ayview Ave)\nWhat: ~6 km family-friendly ride along multi-use paths\, quie
 t streets\, and dedicated cycling infrastructure\, supported by Cycle Toro
 nto ride guides (Route TBD)\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/kidical_mass_2026
 0725
LOCATION:Cycle Toronto Rec Hub at Evergreen Brick Works\n550 Bayview Avenu
 e\nToronto ON M4W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/kidical_mass_20260725
END:VEVENT
